        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "data_truth"
      ],
      "text": "这说明云端长期是“在老 commit 上手动改/运行”,不是正常部署。这个教训也要写进去,以后不论是你还是其他agent接手,都得规范化。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_61c9cce6cd274f3eff3c_d48449ed16ccd3630742"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "0658828f31870e720b9602006fdd8d9df043e970af9a44fe912774a664a37898",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-19T09:16:40.392Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.dc03f8841e276dfe",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "text": "官方协议已核实,请立即按以下精确公式实现并补测试,不要再猜:\n1) headers: x-lt-openKeyId, x-lt-eventCode, x-lt-appid, x-lt-timestamp, x-lt-signature。\n2) openKey = x-lt-appid 存在时取它,否则取 x-lt-openKeyId;requestPath 必须是原始 callback URI path(不含 query,官方也禁止 callback URL 带 query)。\n3) signature 前5字符是 randomKey;signString = apiKey + \"&\" + timestamp + \"&\" + requestPath;secretKey = appSecret + randomKey;HMAC-SHA256 得到 lowercase hex 字符串;对这个 hex UTF-8 字节做 Base64;expected = randomKey + base64Value;constant-time compare。\n4) eventData = Base64 AES/CBC/PKCS5Padding ciphertext;key = Arrays.copyOf(appSecret UTF-8 bytes,16) 的语义(截断或零填充);IV = \"space-station-default-iv\" UTF-8 前16字节。\n5) 官方示例主要是 multipart/form-data 字段 eventData,但文档有 Content-Type 表述冲突;请支持 multipart 为主,并兼容 application/json、[REDACTED OPAQUE TOKEN]。严格 body size。\n6) 超过1.5秒平台会判超时,因此 receiver 必须只做验签/解密/最小校验/持久入库,成功后快速2xx;业务处理异步。\n保持你既有文件所有权,完成后说明测试和变更。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_cc7c4012a49d06fcbfdf_0658828f31870e720b96"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "4357c22d22024954a344ac6a02816e92c4cef32d94d69615bafd9df95acb7258",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-26T03:55:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.b8cf0ef375f1",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "真实 SHEIN 写操作仍必须走 dry-run、人工确认、审计回读和按动作 payload 适配器,不能静默执行。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_1f1b7ffe12af0a645ce9_4357c22d22024954a344"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "a109d1537da2aed07fd5a2d4f24eb985d7c8432d26e2743f3bb49140e92b8d6b",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-11T09:45:29.113Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.execution.e6b20d13fb0f",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "主任务已核实 V3 文档明确“英文和阿文可复制,中文仅供核对”;SK-13015 19 个历史成功新发 payload 也均仅 ar,en 各5行。请把用户要求解释为内容源锁,不默认要求 zh-cn 写平台:实现应锁定三语原文与各自SHA,payload默认仅 AR/EN,ZH作为审计参考;仍需报告官方 schema 对字段/语言的证据与这个选择的依据。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_ca53c7851cc1254e025e_a109d1537da2aed07fd5"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "df1f9b780e12db9774d8872db6e836cc3b798cc179b64a23277b1479da2680e8",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T10:56:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.f3c7a00668f52e93",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "敏感字段扫描不得包含任何应用密钥、开放平台密钥标识、临时令牌、访问或刷新令牌、会话凭证及鉴权头内容;只保留字段类别的脱敏描述。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b125e9c5388abc5f3502_df1f9b780e12db9774d8"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "581daca7f248b34d8f8b057000544f80792b57549842c0fc0434b07997e522f7",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-24T05:04:18.644Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.images.stores.4b76f6749f19",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "images",
        "stores"
      ],
      "text": "DL、QY,简约、现代、都市、白灰\n\nYJ、JY,意式\n\nDX、XL,浅色奢华、金色\n\nHL、LQ,奶油ins风\n\nTZZ,家居性感风\n\nZL、CX,法式,法式复古\n\nTS、QH,海洋系、度假风、蓝色系\n\nMZ、XC,森系、自然系\n\nFY、JSH, 沙漠风、岩土风、沙特传统\n\nNM、TZ,深色奢华系,黑金\n\n店铺匹配的图片风格规则,更新一下。以最新为准。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b4b429555219d1300682_581daca7f248b34d8f8b"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "ccac4cf0f68f895682d9ff44b9a868b365f9d5c9e94bee68dba336347366e3cc",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-20T15:58:00.000Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.inventory.product_identity.577370746ad7",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "product_identity",
        "inventory"
      ],
      "text": "不要再把 `ET发货单累计 < ET库存 + 历史销量` 写成“发货单缺采”,也不要用 `ET库存+历史销量` 反推供给下限。只能标为 `ET库存/销量匹配待核`,用于排查货号归并、销量或库存匹配问题。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_b30e7c067f5be1a074c6_ccac4cf0f68f895682d9"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "162a7bf80f6bc4c45a8783fbcf785db97f480e29df92657d5400cd064ef6ed34",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T10:56:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.publish.02a7cbc74d2c",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "stores",
        "data_truth"
      ],
      "text": "不要再按旧记忆把OpenAPI描述成仅单店可用、待审核或默认关闭。旧的单店对账脚本与Windows单店定时入口只作历史诊断,不得替代当前19店正式能力与云端权威状态。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_417e24896a18de43c272_162a7bf80f6bc4c45a87"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "5dd577ffc73eb0d8428658a1c938f8e930e34a3c862337ec75d8f4e73d567c24",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-16T09:47:06.615Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "advisory.stores.80202260f2be",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "stores"
      ],
      "text": "新增一个规则,以后上链接,默认标题匹配店铺的规格是:\n\nJSH用标题一\nDL、TZZ、CX用标题一\nHL、TS、TZ用标题一\nDX、LQ、XC用标题二\nMZ、NM、YJ用标题二\nJY、QY、XL标题三\nFY、QH、ZL用标题三",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_02d58c5187df1c130039_5dd577ffc73eb0d84286"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "0ef63adb75fec5b2589df444cf029b648e1b5d997d565c809c84b7807b09b200",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-30T12:42:00.000Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "execution.remote-script-transport",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "Windows到远端Linux执行复杂脚本时,不要在PowerShell命令行里直接嵌套大段Bash并叠加多层引号;应把脚本内容作为独立临时.sh文件安全传输后执行,或使用经过校验的here-string/base64脚本传输方式。必须避免凭证进入命令行或日志,并在执行后核对退出码和目标端结果。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_29933bba0374c9ef454a_0ef63adb75fec5b2589d"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "79637d43c5e7e60e822d330b384e046d85c84c307e057a59a708c9debd1f98bf",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-07-26T12:38:24.533Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "finance.profit-cost-accounting",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "price",
        "data_truth",
        "product_identity",
        "stores"
      ],
      "text": "利润与成本统一按当前会计事实层计算:利润率=(营收-总成本)/营收;成本只使用在订单发生时已有且数量、采购和头程证据完整的批次,缺头程运费的批次不得作为精确成本;退货费优先使用财务核对单实际值,缺失时才按每个退货包裹13.88 SAR估算;仓储费按货号证据、货号×店铺销量、中央池逐层守恒分摊,不沿用早期按DSY/LGM成交额简单分摊的旧口径。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_f7da6b5d86a86ff6a20c_79637d43c5e7e60e822d"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "cc2da58a5dc14d759541d706e46599c29dae39a8bade88c94aad4847c2e15978",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-06-07T11:39:52.401Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "finance.sales-time-fx",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "data_truth",
        "price",
        "identity",
        "stores"
      ],
      "text": "销售统计以订单创建时间作为归属时间;项目固定经营换算口径为1 SAR=1.8 RMB,除非负责人明确更新该会计换算常量。分组小计与全店总额必须来自同一订单事实层并可相互加总校验,不得使用抓取时间或页面更新时间替代订单创建时间。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_56e8b2ed207b6ad7d29a_cc2da58a5dc14d759541"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "08d96c0268dcc8b3adcb2e6075504c7edcbd316fc5c41e2bbfc526bd28312a5a",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-13T12:20:17.687Z",
      "risk": "low",
      "ruleKey": "governance.owner-knowledge.owner-only",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity"
      ],
      "text": "只有负责人本人在本机 Codex、CLI 或本人 BI 任务结束时生成规则检查单并确认规则;其他人的任务不生成检查单、候选、覆盖记录或任何负责人规则数据。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_817d57f5f6a756072e2d_08d96c0268dcc8b3adcb"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "43e7846b6dfb88934661dc6948dd125542c2fee1221726277cfec7b36dc66464",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-05-07T05:15:22.109Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "inventory.et-docs",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "inventory",
        "data_truth",
        "price"
      ],
      "text": "ET货代仓与单据口径:ETRUH09是日常运营散件可售仓,ETRUH06是报废仓,ETRUH03_RTV是退货/转运仓,ETRUH04是破损待处理仓,ETRUH01是整箱仓;SK-03038等一件一箱例外可按已确认规则使用01仓。发货申请单表示国内到海外的批次与在途事实,出库单表示发给买家的出库事实,RTV表示退回仓库事实,损溢单表示头程、清关等环节破损或丢失。库存、成本和利润必须按这些事实语义使用,不得混为同一类库存或单据。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_bdad4261bf9d7d66c970_43e7846b6dfb88934661"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "c97eb37f8fd3fea44ad0ae8cbff0a6fce65ea2bfe97ea55b56cb71a75ec10cdc",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.523Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "listing.publish.duplicate-link-fail-closed",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "publish",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "上新提交前必须检查同店同货、历史Seller SKU和已有有效链接;冲突时阻断或进入负责人明确批准的重复分支,不得静默创建第二条。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_dd7e7da05eb09e62ff65_c97eb37f8fd3fea44ad0"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "c50d9167a1904a4977a1f27d4b903bbf3054644a99865a274f78a830d69f6241",
      "explicitDurable": true,
