      "text": "上新前应锁定源店铺、源链接、源SKC、目标店铺、类目、官方属性、图片及角色、描述、标题组、商品身份、价格、库存、重复链接判断、同一任务ID、完整提交哈希与授权;材料变更后旧预检失效,提交后必须逐字段终态回读。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_258001b6a743a7857415_c50d9167a1904a4977a1"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "36faa5866e365056a1b9e1b4f6a2edc8d80f1fb9b503cb971f4df4df75d8d071",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.558Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "marketing.latest-final-plan-baseline",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "marketing",
        "execution"
      ],
      "text": "后续营销方案必须继承上一期最后确认且实际执行或等待执行的最终方案,不得从旧默认、旧草稿或重新扫描后的默认策略重新起算。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_ba4f48e37fb4642937e2_36faa5866e365056a1b9"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "cb19f7432d18b2dce51ced095c854dd2dc8b4725904c1e20e3ff47083a817065",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.590Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "marketing.limited-discount-duration-by-scenario",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "publish",
        "price",
        "marketing"
      ],
      "text": "限时折扣周期必须按场景区分:新品、重上架和高点击等短期场景使用当前 7 天规则;全部在售链接的持续兜底使用当前 30 天规则;负责人特批按明确截止时间。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_bc455a296d282b088352_cb19f7432d18b2dce51c"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "ffbe1ad72b63a9fe8de0379e490f03c7a9414e24bba3cb7b95954df4c713fc92",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.548Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "marketing.price-decimal-safety",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "price",
        "marketing"
      ],
      "text": "营销价格可在平台允许、目标价和利润安全边界内做小数微调,但不得机械取整或突破价格与成本门槛。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_2860cc8b548af0341c53_ffbe1ad72b63a9fe8de0"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "22cc802b6a4c212976fd1f545da003bc318164c39d49b2179b2785e7960e669d",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.580Z",
      "risk": "medium",
      "ruleKey": "marketing.price-stack-current",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "identity",
        "price",
        "marketing"
      ],
      "text": "营销长期顺序是普通活动最高优先且必须覆盖符合条件对象,限时折扣是所有符合条件在售链接的强制兜底层,优惠券仅限负责人批准的小范围实验并在冲突时让位。",
      "version": 1,
      "versionId": "okr_36310124dbd709d0358a_22cc802b6a4c212976fd"
    },
    {
      "activation": "active",
      "contentHash": "c5813efbf653e427b0d0206e135c29f2ae31b8d90c113ad23704b376b90aaa9c",
      "explicitDurable": true,
      "machinePolicy": null,
      "publishedAt": "2026-08-14T11:34:47.536Z",
      "risk": "high",
      "ruleKey": "openapi.product-stock-evidence-boundary",
      "scope": [
        "project:shein-sales-bi"
      ],
      "tags": [
        "publish",
        "inventory"
      ],
      "text": "OpenAPI 商品接口只能证明是否已上架的二值状态,不能替代链接生命周期四态;OpenAPI 库存是平台虚拟可售证据,不能替代 ET 实际库存。",
      "version": 1,
